{
  "movie_id": 201000801,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 0.7,
      "end_time": 1.3,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 2.0,
      "end_time": 3.5,
      "text": "What in the..."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 4.0,
      "end_time": 5.8,
      "text": "The world just changed around me?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 6.9,
      "end_time": 9.2,
      "text": "Did I step on another warp trap?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 10.4,
      "end_time": 13.9,
      "text": "No, it's not just the world that changed!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 20.6,
      "end_time": 21.8,
      "text": "What the—?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 22.5,
      "end_time": 23.8,
      "text": "My horns are gone..."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 26.0,
      "end_time": 27.7,
      "text": "But this is still me."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 28.4,
      "end_time": 32.2,
      "text": "Somehow it feels like a perfectly natural sight..."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 33.7,
      "end_time": 34.3,
      "text": "Wahh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 35.0,
      "end_time": 36.2,
      "text": "R-Rei?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 36.8,
      "end_time": 38.5,
      "text": "You must be... Hiyori?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 38.7,
      "end_time": 41.0,
      "text": "Oh! It really is you, Rei!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 41.5,
      "end_time": 44.5,
      "text": "Wh-wh-wh-what the heck is happening to us?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 44.8,
      "end_time": 47.4,
      "text": "Before I knew it, I was in this place I've never seen!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 47.7,
      "end_time": 49.8,
      "text": "And we both look different too, don't we?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 50.1,
      "end_time": 52.6,
      "text": "Ahhhh, without my ears and tail,"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 52.9,
      "end_time": 57.3,
      "text": "I feel so weird and off-balance!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 58.5,
      "end_time": 59.7,
      "text": "Calm down..."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 60.5,
      "end_time": 63.5,
      "text": "Let's take some deep breaths and try to think."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 65.0,
      "end_time": 67.1,
      "text": "Hm? Where's Yui?"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 67.8,
      "end_time": 72.7,
      "text": "Since you're here, Hiyori, I thought Yui must be nearby as well."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 73.1,
      "end_time": 77.2,
      "text": "Yeah, nobody can separate the three of us! ♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 77.4,
      "end_time": 78.4,
      "text": "Huh, that's weird."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 78.9,
      "end_time": 80.3,
      "text": "I don't see her either."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 81.8,
      "end_time": 83.7,
      "text": "Hey! Yui!"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 84.0,
      "end_time": 85.7,
      "text": "If you're here, say something!"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 89.3,
      "end_time": 90.2,
      "text": "...No response."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 99.6,
      "end_time": 103.2,
      "text": "It seems that for some strange reason,"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 103.7,
      "end_time": 107.9,
      "text": "just the two of us have been ensnared in this strange world."
    }
  ],
